+++++++++++#   - <results_dir>/.tmp-<task_id>.err   (provider stderr, populated during run)
+++++++++++#   - <results_dir>/.tmp-<task_id>.out   (provider stdout, populated during run)
+++++++++++#   - <results_dir>/*-<task_id>.md       (final assembled output, after spawn finishes)
+++++++++++#
